The '''''Nau'ur''-class yacht''', also commonly known as the '''Kalevalan star yacht''' or just '''Kalevalan''', was a type of custom-order luxurious [[yacht]] manufactured by [[Kalevala Spaceworks]]. Notable ''Nau'ur''-class yachts included the ''[[First Light]]'', owned by [[Dryden Vos]], a high ranking member of the criminal [[Crimson Dawn]] syndicate, and the ''[[Coronet]]'', owned by [[Duchess]] [[Satine Kryze]] of [[Mandalore]].<ref name="S&S" /> Several Kalevalan yachts were part of the [[Dawn Fleet]].<ref name="Hidden Empire 4">[[Hidden Empire 4|''Hidden Empire'' 4]]</ref>

